oh my gosh  okay  so good afternoon  i'm very pleased and happy to welcome  here president  maya sandu  a very warm welcome again here in the  berlin we had in during the last weeks  and month intensive talks several  meetings phone calls in particular about  the glass gas supply crisis in moldova  i have announced an emergency package to  step up our support to moldova and i'm  very glad that today commissioner vahley  and the foreign minister for moldova  will both sign the package  um we are providing 60 million euro to  reduce the impact of the rising gas  prices on the most vulnerable people in  moldova  i am of course also looking very much  forward to our discussions which we will  have this afternoon at the eastern  partnership summit  and there we will not only address these  topics but also of course other topics  like how to fight the pandemics but also  the tension in the neighborhood and our  investment economic and investment plan  for the region  of the eastern partnership so very warm  welcome dear maya good to have you here  thank you very much  thank you madam president of the  european commission  the  ceremony is again proof to the  fact that eastern partnership has been  successful to moldova  and i would like to take this  opportunity to thank you again and to  thank you the institutions of the eu for  the support that they've been providing  to us  during goods and during bad times the eu  support is very important for our  development agenda  the eu support comes as solidarity help  when we badly need it and the energy  crisis is such an example  and the the  resources the support that we're  receiving today is going to go  for the  vulnerable people for the people with  low incomes  but we're also looking forward to  continue to work with you and with your  team to provide for energy security for  the country so that will not  have to face crisis situations like this  in the future thank you very much again  and very happy to see here to to 